Check 4. Database scripts — PASS (inspection only; the scripts were not run).
g3-crosscheck.ts is read-only in form: SET default_transaction_read_only (line 296),
BEGIN READ ONLY (line 297), isReadOnlySql on both SELECTs (line 289), ROLLBACK (line
306), client.end() in finally (line 308), and the URL comes from
MONOREPO_DATABASE_URL with an error text that holds no value (line 334). Its writes
go only to the --out, --report, and merged paths. g3-daniel-run.sh starts the Cloud
SQL proxy in the background (line 76) and stops it through trap cleanup EXIT (lines
54-60); every write target is OUT_DIR, the handoff folder (line 29); set -euo
pipefail holds (line 25); the script refuses to run when port 5433 is already in use
(lines 67-70). Nothing is written inside the git tree.

